      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_chairman_03",
      "hash64": "7A9A986FC1DE8151",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Hm? Champion [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?\\nI\\r\\ncertainly\\r\\ndidn’t\\r\\nexpect\\r\\nto\\r\\nrun\\r\\ninto\\r\\nyou\\r\\nhere...[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
