    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_chairman_05",
      "hash64": "7A9A9A6FC1DE84B7",
      "text": "Your talent is as brilliant as always, I see. Truly a\\nwonderful thing.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_chairman_06",
      "hash64": "7A9A9B6FC1DE866A",
      "text": "If you’ll be going along, then I suppose that\\nbodes well...[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_chairman_07",
      "hash64": "7A9A9C6FC1DE881D",
      "text": "Is it all right if I explain the situation to the\\nchildren, Briar?[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_bbteacher_16",
      "hash64": "FA3034C9DB9C0654",
      "text": "By all means.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_chairman_08",
      "hash64": "7A9A8D6FC1DE6EA0",
      "text": "First, allow me to introduce myself.\\c\\nMy name is Geeta. I am the chairwoman of\\nthe Pokémon League in Paldea.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_chairman_09",
      "hash64": "7A9A8E6FC1DE7053",
      "text": "More than a decade ago, the Pokémon League\\nprovided support for research on Area Zero—the\\r\\ngreat crater at the center of Paldea.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_chairman_10",
      "hash64": "7A9E1B6FC1E195C1",
      "text": "Once that research was complete, we shifted\\nour duties to monitoring and managing the area.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_chairman_11",
      "hash64": "7A9E1A6FC1E1940E",
      "text": "Area Zero is full of mysteries—and also danger.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_chairman_12",
      "hash64": "7A9E196FC1E1925B",
      "text": "Generally speaking, the area is off-limits, even\\nfor research.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_chairman_13",
      "hash64": "7A9E186FC1E190A8",
      "text": "That being said...[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_chairman_14",
      "hash64": "7A9E1F6FC1E19C8D",
      "text": "Recently, we’ve had to confront the possibility\\nthat dangerous Pokémon could escape the area.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_chairman_15",
      "hash64": "7A9E1E6FC1E19ADA",
      "text": "There’s a clear need for further research—\\nand quickly.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_chairman_16",
      "hash64": "7A9E1D6FC1E19927",
      "text": "But at our Pokémon League, we’ve had\\ntrouble finding capable personnel—not to\\r\\nmention time—to study Area Zero.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 113,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_chairman_17",
      "hash64": "7A9E1C6FC1E19774",
      "text": "So...[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_bbteacher_17",
      "hash64": "FA3035C9DB9C0807",
      "text": "You reached out to me, as I’ve been requesting\\naccess to the area for quite some time now.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_chairman_18",
      "hash64": "7A9E136FC1E18829",
      "text": "I apologize that we are not better equipped to\\ndeal with this ourselves.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_chairman_19",
      "hash64": "7A9E126FC1E18676",
      "text": "Blueberry Academy has a wealth of highly skilled\\nTrainers with well-trained Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_chairman_20",
      "hash64": "7AA1216FC1E3D5CA",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]And with Champion [VAR 0x0100(0000)]\\nalso\\r\\non\\r\\nthe\\r\\nteam,\\r\\nI’d\\r\\nknow\\r\\nI\\r\\ncould\\r\\nsafely\\r\\ninitiate\\r\\na\\r\\nnew\\r\\nexpedition.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
